	<!--
		The unprefixed semantic aliases (DisplayLarge, BodyMedium, ...) are
		late-bound in code (FluentTheme): <StaticResource> alias elements
		resolve at parse time against the app-level scope only — when the theme
		is instantiated below app scope they cannot see this bundle's own keys,
		and silently bind to a foreign app-level theme's key of the same name
		if one exists (see specs/lessons.md).
	-->

</ResourceDictionary>
